  "content": "\n\n<h1>Aimz - PVP 準星</h1>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">簡介</span></p>\n<p>此自訂準星最初是為我的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">DarkRPG</a> 整合包所設計，現已作為獨立模組發布。&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">描述</span></p>\n<p>透過將原版標準準星替換為專為 PvP 設計的樣式，進一步提升您的原版遊戲體驗。非常適合在 PvP 環境中使用，在單人模式或一般伺服器中同樣適用。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/buy me a coffee-support-orange?style=for-the-badge\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/uCPfPBvsRJ\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/chat-discord-blue?style=for-the-badge\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/gamerpotion/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/my other-projects-orange?style=for-the-badge\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/get a server-click here-blue?style=for-the-badge\"></a></p>\n<p><br>尋找更多準星、字型或資源包？請查看我的其他專案 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/gamerpotion/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/658/680/2023-05-09_01.png\" width=\"1142\" height=\"442\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">今天就申請一台伺服器與朋友一起遊玩！點擊 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a> 或下方橫幅，並使用代碼 <strong>GAMERPOTION</strong> 享 25% 折扣！</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/671/53840b7f-f250-4a97-8995-c3544ae3e296.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/uCPfPBvsR